[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="Station" load_steps=2 format=3]

; Secondary yard in Delta Corridor — E5.2. Free Haulers hold the berth
; (Job 6 phase 2 / finding IF-24): the co-op offers every Act III ignition and
; lends the starting debt, so they need one dock where their board, their
; contacts and their recovery chains can actually be reached. Reach Authority
; keeps the four docks it had, including every one the campaign spine uses.
[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://src/data/shapes/Station.gd" id="1"]

